sequence-diagram

HR User [icon: user] > React Frontend [icon: layout]: Select employee & attestation type
React Frontend > Spring Boot API [icon: cloud-cog]: POST /api/attestations
Spring Boot API > AttestationService [icon: function]: generateAttestation(attestationDto)

AttestationService > MySQL Database [icon: database]: Find employee by ID
MySQL Database > AttestationService: Return employee data

AttestationService > TemplateService [icon: function]: Get template by type
TemplateService > MySQL Database: Find template by name
MySQL Database > TemplateService: Return JRXML template
TemplateService > AttestationService: Return template content

AttestationService > JasperReports [icon: file]: Compile JRXML template
JasperReports > AttestationService: Return compiled template

AttestationService > JasperReports: Fill template with employee data
JasperReports > AttestationService: Generate PDF bytes

AttestationService > File System [icon: folder]: Save PDF to pdfs/ folder
AttestationService > MySQL Database: Save attestation record
MySQL Database > AttestationService: Confirm save

AttestationService > Spring Boot API: Return success response
Spring Boot API > React Frontend: Return success + file info
React Frontend > HR User: Show success notification

note over HR User,File System: PDF is now available for download